#' @title Hierarchical Clustering with Fixed-k and Dynamic Tree Cut
#'
#' @description
#' Performs unsupervised hierarchical clustering on a low-dimensional embedding (e.g., PCA)
#' using two strategies:
#' \itemize{
#'   \item \strong{Fixed-k}: Cuts the dendrogram at a user-specified number of clusters.
#'   \item \strong{Dynamic tree cut}: Uses `dynamicTreeCut` to detect natural cluster boundaries.
#' }
#' Clusters are labeled using TCGA reference centroids via `label_by_tcga()`.
#' Outputs include:
#' - CSV tables of sample assignments
#' - Dendrogram PDFs
#' - Silhouette plot (dynamic cut only)
#'
#' @param PC Matrix of principal components or reduced features (samples x PCs).
#'           Row names must be sample IDs.
#' @param V_adj Normalized expression matrix (genes x samples). Used for TCGA centroid mapping.
#'              Row names = gene symbols/IDs; column names = sample IDs.
#' @param features Character vector of gene symbols (e.g., PAM50) used for centroid mapping.
#' @param metadata_ann Path to TCGA metadata CSV or a `data.frame` with sample annotations.
#' @param V_tcga Vector of TCGA sample IDs used as reference (must exist in `metadata_ann`).
#' @param dataset_lab Character scalar or vector labeling the dataset (e.g., "DSMZ", "TCGA").
#'                    Recycled if length 1.
#' @param outdir Output directory. Created if it doesn't exist.
#' @param k_fixed Integer >= 2. If `NULL`, fixed-k clustering is skipped.
#' @param seed Random seed for reproducibility (used in `run_fixed_hc()`).
#'
#' @return A named list:
#' \item{fixed}{List with `hc`, `clusters` (labeled), and `df` (tibble), or `NULL` if skipped.}
#' \item{dynamic}{List with `hc`, `clusters` (labeled), `df`, and `silhouette` object.}
#'
#' @dependencies
#' - `helpers.R`: `log_info()`, `log_warn()`, `safe_pdf()`, `choose_minCluster()`
#' - `run_fixed_hc()`, `label_by_tcga()`, `plot_dendrogram_fixed()`,
#'   `run_dynamic_cut()`, `plot_dendrogram_dynamic()`, `plot_silhouette()`
#'
#' @export
#' @examples
#' \dontrun{
#' result <- run_hierarchical_clustering(
#'   PC = pca_obj$x,
#'   V_adj = vst_mat,
#'   features = pam50_genes,
#'   metadata_ann = "tcga_metadata.csv",
#'   V_tcga = tcga_samples,
#'   dataset_lab = "DSMZ",
#'   outdir = "results/hc",
#'   k_fixed = 5
#' )
#' }